	""" temporary exposed until we found good values, -8: 1/256, -10: 1/1024 """  # noqa

	HistogramLogMax: float
	""" temporary exposed until we found good values 4: 16, 8: 256 """  # noqa

	CalibrationConstant: float
	""" Calibration constant for 18% albedo. """  # noqa

