	      other updates sent to the client.  Increase this value to reduce client adjustment update frequency, or if the amount of data sent in the clientadjustment() call increases
	"""  # noqa

	MAXCLIENTUPDATEINTERVAL: float
	""" MAXCLIENTUPDATEINTERVAL is the maximum time between movement updates from the client before the server forces an update. """  # noqa

	MaxClientForcedUpdateDuration: float
	""" MaxClientForcedUpdateDuration is the maximum time duration over which the server will force updates, after MAXCLIENTUPDATEINTERVAL is initially exceeded. """  # noqa

	ServerForcedUpdateHitchThreshold: float
