	The string 192.16?.12.10 will deny all addresses in the range 192.160.12.10-192.169.12.10.

	The format is IP_ADDRESS:PORT_NUMBER.  If port number is 0 then all ports are blocked.
	"""  # noqa

	bShareKnownNodesWithActiveConnections: bool
	""" Whether to share our list of known endpoints with those endpoints.  This allows message processors to completely mesh their networks. """  # noqa

	MaxConcurrentDeserializationTasks: int
	""" Maximum number of deserialization tasks that can be performed in parallel. A value of 0 or 1 means that concurrent
